      "end_timestamp": "00:36",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "The skin round it has gone red, and it's warm. It was fine last week and then, um, over the weekend it changed.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:37",
      "end_timestamp": "00:49",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Any fever or shivering with it?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:51",
      "end_timestamp": "00:55",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "No, no fever. I've felt a bit tired, but I've no temperature.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:56",
      "end_timestamp": "01:02",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Good. I'll look in a moment, but first, let's go through your medicines, because I know there's a few.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:05",
      "end_timestamp": "01:15",
      "supports": [
        "medications[0]",
        "medications[1]",
        "medications[2]",
        "medications[3]",
        "medications[4]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Right. The antibiotic they gave me, flucloxacillin, maybe 500 mg, four times a day, I think? I'd have to check the box. Then paracetamol, 1 gram, when I need it.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:16",
      "end_timestamp": "01:32",
      "supports": [
        "medications[0]",
        "medications[1]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "That's maybe 500 mg of the flucloxacillin, we'll check the box, thank you. What else?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:35",
      "end_timestamp": "01:44",
      "supports": [
        "medications[0]",
        "medications[2]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Ramipril, 2.5 mg once a day. Simvastatin, 20 mg at night. And my metformin, 500 mg twice a day.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:47",
      "end_timestamp": "01:57",
      "supports": [
        "medications[2]",
        "medications[3]",
        "medications[4]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Good, that matches what I've got. And your background conditions?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:58",
